        "created_at": "2012-05-02T23:25:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I actually like Axe’s idea: maybe he’ll play where he picks one target, and just focuses all damage on that one hero, and when they die, he moves onto the next one. Then his flip mechanic might be something like “flip when a hero dies”. But I doubt both of those are likely. He’ll probably still have lots of attacks that do various things. It’d be weird for a villain to literally focus on one hero, basically ensuring that every game, someone will die. I mean, it could work, and would be cool, but I can’t see it actually happening.</p>",
