      {
        "id": 28335,
        "name": "Craig",
        "username": "Craig",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-02T23:50:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Frankly, I’m expecting something more along the lines of a stealth attack. Perhaps, through some as-yet-unrevealed mechanic, the players won’t know who he’s attacking until it happens. This seems in line with the stalking hunter idea he seems to have.</p>",
