        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-02T23:54:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As far as focusing on a particular character goes, all he would have to do is target the hero with the lowest hit points.  I can’t tell you how many times I’ve fought Voss on Atlantis where Tempest became the punching bag for Krakens, Ion-Lancers, Voss’s personal attack, or what have you.</p>",
