      {
        "id": 28337,
        "name": "Tamar",
        "username": "Tamar",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/85f322/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-05-03T03:02:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;evandan55&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"evandan55\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But the kickstarter said… He got genetic modifications… And they we’re from drugs? Weird. Then what did they do? Shoot him with radiation? No, that would just give him radiation poisoning or something… Who knows anything about biology? Someone explain how genetics can be changed without drugs. I’m no good with biology.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It’s comics science!  When faced with something implausible, the answer is always “Because Comics”!</p>",
